First, we determine the number of friends Amy made. Amy made 20 more friends than Lily, and Lily made 50 friends. Therefore, Amy made 50 + 20 = 70 friends.

Next, we find the total number of friends Lily and Amy have together. Lily has 50 friends and Amy has 70 friends, so together they have 50 + 70 = 120 friends.

