completions_1:
Tom gets 4 car washes a month, and car washes cost $15 each. So the monthly cost is 4 car washes * $15/car wash = $60 per month.
There are 12 months in a year. Therefore, the annual cost is $60/month * 12 months/year = $720 per year.

\boxed{720}

