First, we need to figure out how many minutes are in 3 hours. There are 60 minutes in an hour, so 3 hours * 60 minutes/hour = 180 minutes.

Next, we know John can collect 2 peaches per minute.  So, in 180 minutes, he will collect 180 minutes * 2 peaches/minute = 360 peaches.

\boxed{360}
